[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "小娘养——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗跑起来的时候，腰间那只空酒葫芦是第一个响的。\n它撞在胯骨上，发出一种闷的、瓷的声响——不是脆响，是被葫芦口塞住的引魂香芯子撞到葫芦壁的闷响。临安城的巷子窄"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "还没开始活的",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他闭嘴了。\n在临安城里，腰间挂引魂香葫芦的人只有两种。一种是死了的，一种是快死的。\n沈小碗两种都不是。她是\"还没开始活的\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "十二筹",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她跑了三条巷。身后的脚步声只跟了第一条巷就停了——天机阁的小角色她甩得开。但她不敢停。她闻到了。空气里多了一种味道：铁锈味混着算筹的油墨味。\n这是天机阁\"十二筹"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "先生，先生！",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她没回头。她把右手摸到腰后的竹筒上——那是她大师兄留给她的暗器，二十根透骨钉，每根喂过三种毒。她抽出第一根时手是稳的。\n巷子到了尽头。\n尽头是一堵墙。墙根下趴着"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九没反应。\n沈小碗的鼻尖凑近他脖颈。引魂香的味道从他身上散出来——比她身上的还浓十倍。她是神女\"魂\"的一半，引魂香是她天生的味道。但眼前这个人身上没有引魂香的"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你身上的香……",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "是被引来的。\n陆九的左手忽然动了一下。他没抬头，但他的嘴在说话。声音从泥里传出来，闷得像从棺材里说话：\"你身上的香……\"\n\"小娘养的，你还活着。\" 沈小碗骂了一"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我师妹身上也有这种香。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗没说话。她的手往竹筒上又按了一根透骨钉。\n\"我师妹身上也有这种香。\" 陆九说，\"但我师妹的香是冷的。你的是热的。\"\n沈小碗忽然笑了。她的笑是咬着牙笑的，牙"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他没站起来。\n他的左手在泥里摸了一下。摸到了一样东西。是一个极小的、硬物。他把它捏在指间，没让沈小碗看见。\n是龟壳上第八道纹断下来的那一小片。\n断片上刻着一个字"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "先生笑什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他忽然笑了。\n他的笑是埋在泥里的笑，沈小碗看不见。但她听见他嗓子里\"咯\"了一声。\n\"先生笑什么？\"\n\"我算到了。\" 陆九说。\n\"算什么？\"\n\"算到追你的人。\" "
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*拿不下*",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗的竹筒抬起。\n她没问陆九\"你怎么知道\"。她已经知道答案了。引魂香在她身上十二年，她自己算不到自己，但**别人**算得到。一个算卦的人，靠她身上的香，能\"闻"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*怎么死*",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗愣了一下。\n\"他算不到自己？\" 她问，\"他不是'十二筹'吗？天机阁第一追杀手——\"\n\"他算不到自己今日会**怎么死**。\" 陆九说，\"他算到了会死。算不到"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "那我不杀他。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗的右手忽然松了。\n她不按竹筒了。她把透骨钉塞回竹筒。竹筒插回腰后。\n\"那我不杀他。\" 她说。\n\"为什么？\"\n\"因为我大师兄也是这样死的。\" 沈小碗说，\"他"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "不在了",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九从泥里翻过身来。\n他第一次正眼看沈小碗。\n他的左眼是瞎的——但此刻左眼上挂着的那滴泪还没干。泪在眼眶里晃。他的右眼刚瞎——什么都看不见。\n他只能用**鼻**"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*你大师兄",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗的手忽然一抖。\n她腰间那只空酒葫芦又撞了一下胯骨。\n\"你怎么知道？\"\n\"我闻到了。\" 陆九说，\"你葫芦里塞的引魂香——是**你大师兄**的香骨做的。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*师父最疼的徒弟",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗的嘴张了一下。没发出声音。\n\"你大师兄是你师父杀的。\" 陆九说，\"你师父用你大师兄的香骨做了这根引魂香——因为香骨必须用**师父最疼的徒弟**的骨头做。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*你师父*",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗的右手又摸到竹筒上。\n但她没拔透骨钉。\n\"你怎么知道？\"\n\"我算不到我自己。\" 陆九说，\"但我能算到**你师父**。你师父的命格里有一笔账——是欠你大师兄"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你胡说。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗忽然站起来。\n她站得太快，腰间葫芦又撞了一下。\n\"你胡说。\" 她的声音变了——之前是快、密、不喘气，现在变得很慢，\"我师父是好人。\"\n\"我没说他坏。\" 陆"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我算卦算不准你师父。但我算准了一件事：你大师兄死前，把一样东西藏在破庙里。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他顿了顿。\n\"我算卦算不准你师父。但我算准了一件事：你大师兄死前，把一样东西藏在破庙里。\"\n\"什么东西？\"\n\"一封信。\" 陆九说，\"信里写——你师父的真名。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "嗒、嗒、嗒",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗没说话。\n巷子尽头传来一声极轻的脚步声。\n不是跑。是**走**。一步一步的木屐声。\"嗒、嗒、嗒\"。每步之间隔了半息。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "沈小碗。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "是白无垢。\n陆九的右手把龟壳断片塞进了自己嘴里。\n他没吐。他的嘴在咀嚼。龟壳很硬，他嚼了三下，吐出一根血丝。断片在他嘴里被血泡软了，融化了——化成一股铁锈味的水"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我信你。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "沈小碗的右手离开了竹筒。\n她的右手摸到了自己腰间的空葫芦。葫芦口塞着的引魂香——她大师兄的香骨——在她指尖下微微发烫。\n\"我信你。\" 她说，\"因为我大师兄死的那"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "巷子尽头的木屐声停了。\n白无垢站在巷口。\n他的右手还藏在玄色袖里。但这次他没笑。他的金瞳竖瞳眯着，盯着陆九的左眼。\n\"陆先生。\" 白无垢说，\"陆先生把断片吃了？"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 23,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢没说话。\n他的右手从袖里伸出来。铁手。指节咯吱咯吱响着，五指张开，对准陆九。\n\"陆先生。\" 白无垢说，\"天机阁想请陆先生去临安分舵。\"\n\"不去。\"\n\"为什"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 24,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我算到——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "那是一只本该瞎了二十四年的眼睛。\n眼珠不是灰白色。眼珠是清澈的**红**——像被血泡过，又像被火烧过。\n白无垢的右手停了。\n\"我算到——\" 陆九说，\"我头顶发绿"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 25,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*是你给我下的。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼直直盯着白无垢。\n\"**是你给我下的。**\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 26,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的金瞳竖瞳里，第一次出现了**裂纹**。\n那条裂纹从他的右眼角往下，斜斜地劈开他的脸颊——是算筹形的裂纹。\n他笑了。\n\"陆先生。\" 他说，\"陆先生瞎了二十"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 27,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "今日**该开**了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他往前走了一步。\n\"今日**该开**了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 28,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*卷了起来",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左眼流下了一滴血。\n不是泪。是血。\n血滴在地上，泥地里的那根褪色红绳——被陆九揣进怀里之前掉在泥里的那根——**卷了起来**。\n它卷成了一个环。\n环的形状"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 29,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我会**笑**。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼眨了一下。\n\"我会**笑**。\"\n沈小碗没明白什么叫\"笑一招\"。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 30,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "咚、咚、咚",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但她已经跑了。\n她跑得很快。腰间葫芦撞胯骨的声音\"咚、咚、咚\"。她跑到巷口时回头看了一眼——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 31,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她看见陆九的左手按在龟壳断片的位置——但断片已经在他胃里了。他左手按着自己的肚子。\n他按着肚子的姿势——像在按住一只要破肚而出的**龟**。\n白无垢的右手停住了"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 32,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*从肚子里",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九笑了。\n他的笑不是从嘴角展开的。是**从肚子里**展开的。从胃里。从他吃下去的龟壳断片的位置。\n\"我赌——\" 陆九说，\"我赌白阁主今日——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 33,
    "space": "Physical",
