    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*我赌白阁主今日——出不了这招。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼闭上又睁开。\n那一刹那，他的左眼**白**了。\n整个眼球变成乳白色。\n像他二十三岁那年的左眼一样。\n但这一次，不是盲——是**亮**。\n亮得像一只新的、"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 34,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*动不了*",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的右手没动。\n不是不想动。是**动不了**。\n他的右手——那只铁手——被某种力量定在了半空。\n那种力量，从陆九的肚子里，从龟壳断片的位置，**长出了一根极"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 35,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*深了一分",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的金瞳竖瞳里，那条算筹形的裂纹**深了一分**。\n\"我师妹——\" 陆九说，\"二十四年前被白阁主从火场里拖走的师妹——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 36,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*他师妹的脸",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼完全白了。\n乳白色的眼球里，映出了一张脸。\n是**他师妹的脸**。\n不是模糊的。是**清晰的**。\n像她二十四年前被人拖走时、回头看他的那一眼——但**"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 37,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*也是龟壳做的",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼流下了一滴**白**色的泪。\n\"白阁主的右手，**也是龟壳做的**。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 38,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的笑——终于没了。\n他第一次没笑。\n\"陆先生——\" 白无垢的声音变了，\"陆先生怎么知道？\"\n\"我吃的那片断片——\" 陆九说，\"断片上的'陆'字——\""
  },
  {
