    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*眼**——做了",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他的左眼闭上。\n再睁开时，那滴白色的泪已经不在了。\n\"是我师妹**刻**的。\"\n\"师妹刻在我龟壳上的字——'陆'。\"\n\"但'陆'字底下——还有一行小字。\"\n\"小"
  },
  {
