    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*抽动了一下",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的右手——那只铁手——指节里长出的根——**抽动了一下**。\n是龟壳残片的**记忆**在抽动。\n龟壳记得**原主人**。\n原主人是**陆九的师妹**。\n师"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 41,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*师妹的庙",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九吃了断片。\n他把自己的胃——变成了**师妹的庙**。\n白无垢的右手——师妹二十四年前做出来的右手——闻到了**主人**的味道。\n它不动了。\n不是因为定住。\n"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 42,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*不是他发。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "**不是他发。**\n**是他的命格——**在发新芽。\n白无垢第一次往后退了半步。\n他的右手从半空垂下来。指节里的根——**枯了**。\n\"陆先生——\" 白无垢的声"
  },
  {
