    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*师妹想让它掉",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他没说完。\n陆九的左眼**闭**上了。\n陆九整个人——**倒**在泥里。\n不是死。是**睡**。\n他睡着了。\n睡着时嘴角还挂着笑。\n白无垢的右手——那只铁手——"
  },
  {
